  C006 --> C012
  C003 --> C011["${label('55AA-011', 'Systems Security Research Methods', '系统安全科研方法')}"]
`;
---
<figure class="course-graph">
  <figcaption>{zh ? '课程依赖关系（先修课程 → 后续课程）' : 'Course dependencies (prerequisite → subsequent course)'}</figcaption>
  <pre class="mermaid">{graph}</pre>
</figure>

<style>
  .course-graph { margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  figcaption { margin-bottom: .6rem; font-weight: 600; }
